# Qt Creator shadow-build DIRECTORIES (build-<project>-<kit>-<config>). Narrowed from `*build-*`
# on 2026-08-12: as a file-matching glob it silently ignored ANY path containing "build-", which
# swallowed pipelines/onemill-build-windows.yml, and would equally swallow a pipeline named like
# the fleet's own build-validation-windows.yaml. Verified before narrowing that the old pattern
# matched exactly one path in the whole tree (that file) and that no build-* directory exists,
# so this loses no coverage.
build-*/
*.qm
*.prl

# Qt unit tests
target_wrapper.*

# QtCreator
*.autosave

